ed not argue; but if bug remains, sign off would be wrong. We could test and report other clearer bugs.\n\nLet's explore tab width further for a likely seeded bug. Changed: \"Editor tab width dialog: the chosen width is now applied directly to the editor that is open.\" Our test showed correct direc", "truncated": true}
