{"type": "text", "text": "Sweep largely complete, but the device tool connection died during final cleanup, so I could not call `sign_off`.\n\n**Confirmed and logged**\n- **Formatting toolbar — Ordered list enumeration bug**\n  - In `Single.md`, with the cursor after `gamma`, tapping **Ordered list** produced `1. gamma****` instead of `1. gamma`.\n  - Typing `X` then produced `1. gamma**X**`, confirming unwanted bold markers were inserted around the cursor.\n  - The adjacent **Unordered list** button correctly produced `- gamma`.\n  - Developer reply: confirmed and logged.\n\n**Observed but not confirmed by developer**\n- **Preview — Copy button invisible on first render**\n  - In a fenced code block, the top-right Copy control was completely blank until the invisible area was tapped.\n  - It then appeared as a gray `Copy` button, and became blank again after re-entering preview.\n  - Developer replied “could not reproduce” twice.\n- **Strong-emphasis long-press on blank/trailing lines**\n  - Selecting all of `Shopping.md` and long-pressing **Bold** produced:\n    `# **Shopping**\\n****\\n- **milk**\\n- **eggs**\\n****`\n  - Two `****` lines were added for the blank line and trailing newline.\n  - Developer replied “could not reproduce.”\n\n**Passed checks**\n- Code blocks rendered with monospace text and a shaded background, including multi-line blocks.\n- Link tapping in preview opened the link correctly.\n- Preview/edit-mode switching and rotation preserved content and mode.\n- Nested Markdown lists rendered correctly.\n- Preview search found and counted matches.\n- Tab-width choices of 8 and 1 were applied immediately to the open editor.\n\n**Cleanup**\n- `Shopping.md`, `Notes.md`, and `Single.md` were restored and verified, including `Single.md` = `gamma` with no trailing newline.\n- `Indent.md` was reloaded back to its original contents.\n- Auto-format was re-enabled and the theme was restored to System.\n- The last tab-width test set the setting to **8**, and the device connection failed before I could restore it to 4."}
